OL,3,GNEWSAOpen fires warning as crews keep
OL,4,Afighting blazes
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople have been urged not to start
OL,7,Ffires in the open by firefighters, as
OL,8,Fthey tackled a series of blazes over
OL,9,Fthe weekend.
OL,11,FDespite recent rainfall, fire crews
OL,12,Fhave been dealing with a number of
OL,13,Ffires, including at Chatterley
OL,14,FWhitfield Nature Reserve in
OL,15,FStoke-on-Trent and Hankelow in
OL,16,FCheshire.
OL,18,FFirefighters were called to Chatterley
OL,19,FWhitfield at about 17:00 BST on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
